To adapt what I said in the other thread:

Don't forget to pray when in trouble.
Try to get your character up in strength with equipment before the game
has a chance to send in a random monster able to kill you.
Don't drink from fountains.
Keep tabs on the number of "escapes" you have.
Figure out which items are basically useless and which ones will really
help you.
Beware of ants.

Also, while this may count as a spoiler I think it's one of those
things that should be printed in red lettering for all new players: if
you're a newbie and must cheat to complete Sokoban, then don't do
Sokoban if you have any expectation that you'll be needing to pray
before finishing it.

